1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Fourteenth Episode
The Love Letters
The Seven Little Goats

15
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:14,820
It's finally finished!

16
00:02:15,140 --> 00:02:17,920
The Garigori-style camera is complete!

17
00:02:18,020 --> 00:02:19,240
Quickly, quickly.

18
00:02:20,305 --> 00:02:23,080
Now, let's give it a test run.

19
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:27,760
I'll make it!

20
00:02:28,140 --> 00:02:30,559
Come on, hurry up, you little fool.

21
00:02:40,020 --> 00:02:41,020
Garigori!

22
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:44,800
I hear you've invented some suspicious contraption called a camera. Is this it?

23
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,673
What are you hiding inside here?

24
00:02:46,954 --> 00:02:48,960
No, no! You mustn't!

25
00:02:48,985 --> 00:02:49,713
Shut up!

26
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:50,880
Let me look!

27
00:03:11,950 --> 00:03:13,100
Prince Sapphire.

28
00:03:13,810 --> 00:03:16,060
The carnival the other day was so much fun.

29
00:03:16,734 --> 00:03:19,380
I haven't enjoyed a carnival like that in a long time.

30
00:03:33,850 --> 00:03:38,900
That night at the carnival, I met a beautiful girl with flaxen hair.

31
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:01,580
I want to go on a date with her again.

32
00:04:01,826 --> 00:04:03,806
Please track her down and let me see her.

33
00:04:04,064 --> 00:04:05,500
I'm counting on you, Prince Franz.

34
00:04:06,356 --> 00:04:07,410
How silly.

35
00:04:07,634 --> 00:04:10,000
That girl was Prince Sapphire all along.

36
00:04:10,155 --> 00:04:11,340
It's time.

37
00:04:11,725 --> 00:04:13,800
Are you taking a picture or not?

38
00:04:13,959 --> 00:04:17,100
I'm busy, so please make up your mind.

39
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:20,260
Hmm, what should I do?

40
00:04:21,130 --> 00:04:22,855
Hurry and decide.

41
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:25,720
My camera is in high demand, you know!

42
00:04:30,180 --> 00:04:31,180
Forget it.

43
00:04:32,590 --> 00:04:33,729
Ah, wait, wait!

44
00:04:34,070 --> 00:04:35,380
Will you take it?

45
00:04:44,100 --> 00:04:46,853
Hey, can you take a picture of me wearing this hat and dress?

46
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:48,653
Prince Sapphire!

47
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:49,760
I guess not...

48
00:04:50,530 --> 00:04:57,126
Look, if you take a picture like that, it'll be perfect proof that you're a girl!

49
00:04:57,490 --> 00:05:00,100
What if Duralumin got his hands on it?

50
00:05:03,091 --> 00:05:05,699
Besides, what would you even do with a photo like that?

51
00:05:06,315 --> 00:05:07,566
I'm not telling.

52
00:05:07,770 --> 00:05:10,326
That's my business.

53
00:05:11,965 --> 00:05:14,040
I understand how you feel.

54
00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:19,680
The pain of having to pretend to be a boy when you were born a beautiful girl...

55
00:05:19,859 --> 00:05:21,980
Garigori understands all too well.

56
00:05:22,355 --> 00:05:22,960
Very well.

57
00:05:23,060 --> 00:05:26,393
I shall use my skills to take just one photo in secret.

58
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:37,200
Wow, look at that smile!

59
00:05:37,795 --> 00:05:40,120
Prince Franz will be amazed when he sees this photo.

60
00:05:40,695 --> 00:05:43,200
To His Highness Prince Franz of Goldland.

61
00:05:47,940 --> 00:05:48,940
Opal!

62
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,080
Go drop this letter in the mailbox.

63
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:01,960
Good boy.

64
00:06:27,486 --> 00:06:29,073
Thank you very much.

65
00:06:29,340 --> 00:06:30,340
Bye-bye!

66
00:06:35,130 --> 00:06:38,305
I want to know who Sapphire sent a letter to and what it says.

67
00:06:38,329 --> 00:06:40,820
Spy 001, Uncle Bond... I'm counting on you!

68
00:06:41,175 --> 00:06:42,896
Leave it to me, Baron Nylon.

69
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:44,660
Now then...

70
00:06:49,585 --> 00:06:51,000
Spy News Flash: Operation Disguise!

71
00:07:06,340 --> 00:07:08,700
Spy News Flash: The Great Mail Heist!

72
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:15,016
Number one-one-one-one... two-two-two-three...

73
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:17,860
Oh my, what a cutie. Very nice!

74
00:07:26,410 --> 00:07:28,693
Spy News Flash: Operation Mail Return!

75
00:07:32,790 --> 00:07:35,040
Uncle Bond, a brilliant performance!

76
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:45,800
What?

77
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:48,460
Are you saying you couldn't find Sapphire's letter?

78
00:07:48,740 --> 00:07:48,993
Yes

79
00:07:49,260 --> 00:07:51,806
The only other suspicious letter is the one to Prince Franz

80
00:07:51,830 --> 00:07:54,700
on sweet-colored paper, signed "From a Girl."

81
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:55,406
What?

82
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:56,640
A letter for the Prince of France?

83
00:07:56,641 --> 00:07:58,400
Yes, that's it. So, what's inside?

84
00:07:58,835 --> 00:07:59,966
A single photograph!

85
00:08:00,255 --> 00:08:03,533
She was a truly beautiful girl, wasn't she?

86
00:08:04,113 --> 00:08:04,895
Idiot!

87
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:05,675
That's the letter!

88
00:08:05,700 --> 00:08:06,700
Fetch that one too!

89
00:08:06,760 --> 00:08:09,260
Spy News Flash: Operation Retrieval!

90
00:08:09,400 --> 00:08:10,400
Get out, you slowpoke!

91
00:08:15,810 --> 00:08:17,683
Heh heh, once I get that photo...

92
00:08:22,630 --> 00:08:25,360
Lord Sapphire, what did you do with that photo?

93
00:08:25,361 --> 00:08:28,633
You must make sure nobody steals it.

94
00:08:29,590 --> 00:08:31,600
It really is unsafe these days.

95
00:08:31,625 --> 00:08:32,720
What happened?

96
00:08:33,165 --> 00:08:36,100
Well, I heard the mail coach was attacked.

97
00:08:36,340 --> 00:08:36,726
What?

98
00:08:37,159 --> 00:08:38,460
What is it, Your Highness?

99
00:08:38,865 --> 00:08:39,865
Where did it happen?

100
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,720
Just outside the north ranch, apparently.

101
00:08:42,065 --> 00:08:43,065
Oh no!

102
00:08:44,633 --> 00:08:45,720
Opal!

103
00:08:46,180 --> 00:08:47,353
They were after my letter!

104
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:48,480
All right, let's go!

105
00:09:08,409 --> 00:09:10,260
Whoa, hey, wait, wait!

106
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:11,820
Wait up, you!

107
00:09:12,849 --> 00:09:14,980
Why does the wind have to blow at a time like this?!

108
00:09:15,285 --> 00:09:16,700
Man, this is getting me so panicked!

109
00:09:16,730 --> 00:09:18,260
Hey, hey, wait up!

110
00:09:20,199 --> 00:09:21,860
After I finally collected them...

111
00:09:22,479 --> 00:09:24,086
You're the mail thief!

112
00:09:30,901 --> 00:09:33,180
Too bad for you, it's got a string attached!

113
00:09:33,375 --> 00:09:34,762
Why, you...!

114
00:09:40,909 --> 00:09:43,080
Spy News Flash: Operation Tree Climb!

115
00:09:45,300 --> 00:09:47,053
Spy News Flash: Operation Endurance!

116
00:09:52,799 --> 00:09:54,893
Spy News Flash: Operation Balloon Flight!

117
00:09:54,961 --> 00:09:55,953
Wait!

118
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,600
Can't wait!

119
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,000
Hey!

120
00:10:05,079 --> 00:10:06,079
All right!

121
00:10:06,205 --> 00:10:07,320
N-No, no, no!

122
00:10:07,330 --> 00:10:08,020
Stop it, stop it!

123
00:10:08,135 --> 00:10:09,200
No way, stop!

124
00:10:09,460 --> 00:10:10,340
No!

125
00:10:10,430 --> 00:10:11,180
No!

126
00:10:11,260 --> 00:10:11,913
Please, no!

127
00:10:20,060 --> 00:10:21,260
Ah, it's no good!

128
00:10:23,239 --> 00:10:24,780
Hey, give that back!

129
00:10:25,705 --> 00:10:29,860
How is darkness like a letter? The answer is... Argh, forget it!

130
00:10:30,206 --> 00:10:31,280
Opal!

131
00:10:41,348 --> 00:10:45,226
I can't catch up. All right then! Spy News Flash: Operation Bunny Hop!

132
00:10:50,834 --> 00:10:52,300
Spy News Flash: Operation Pardon Me!

133
00:10:52,324 --> 00:10:53,366
Wait!

134
00:10:59,539 --> 00:11:00,580
The road splits.

135
00:11:00,805 --> 00:11:01,805
Which way did they go?

136
00:11:17,965 --> 00:11:19,940
Spy News Flash: Operation Handbrake!

137
00:11:20,265 --> 00:11:23,040
Where did that savage hide?

138
00:11:43,839 --> 00:11:44,839
It's Mommy!

139
00:11:44,953 --> 00:11:45,480
Open up!

140
00:11:45,610 --> 00:11:46,740
You can't fool us!

141
00:11:49,409 --> 00:11:51,720
It's the seven little goats!

142
00:12:04,838 --> 00:12:07,745
You didn't let anyone in while I was gone, did you?

143
00:12:07,769 --> 00:12:09,640
No, we didn't!

144
00:12:10,429 --> 00:12:12,120
There are scary humans lurking around.

145
00:12:12,275 --> 00:12:13,520
You must always be careful.

146
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:14,640
Yes, Mother!

147
00:12:14,839 --> 00:12:15,839
Now, here's a treat.

148
00:12:15,864 --> 00:12:18,755
Look, I found some delicious-looking paper.

149
00:12:18,780 --> 00:12:20,146
I'll give it to you for dinner.

150
00:12:20,705 --> 00:12:21,705
Open up!

151
00:12:28,829 --> 00:12:30,080
Aha, that's it!

152
00:12:32,910 --> 00:12:35,193
Spy News Flash: Operation Santa Claus!

153
00:12:35,980 --> 00:12:36,980
Hurry, hurry!

154
00:12:42,100 --> 00:12:43,280
Quick, children, hide!

155
00:12:43,500 --> 00:12:44,500
Okay!

156
00:12:47,569 --> 00:12:48,720
Hurry, hurry!

157
00:12:56,920 --> 00:13:00,280
Down I go, but... YEOW! HOT!

158
00:13:05,969 --> 00:13:07,973
Those goat tracks are strange.

159
00:13:08,205 --> 00:13:09,460
Looks like wolf tracks.

160
00:13:09,710 --> 00:13:10,900
Could it be a wolf in disguise?

161
00:13:19,785 --> 00:13:21,593
No opening anywhere.

162
00:13:21,775 --> 00:13:23,000
They're so cautious!

163
00:13:30,189 --> 00:13:32,253
Spy News Flash: Operation Snoop!

164
00:13:36,134 --> 00:13:37,767
That paper looks delicious.

165
00:13:37,791 --> 00:13:39,293
I can't wait until dinner.

166
00:13:39,317 --> 00:13:40,726
Just one shouldn't hurt, right?

167
00:13:42,390 --> 00:13:43,545
No, no, stop that!

168
00:13:43,570 --> 00:13:45,140
I told you, leave that letter alone!

169
00:13:45,165 --> 00:13:46,866
Stop it, stop!

170
00:13:46,930 --> 00:13:47,930
Hey, stop!

171
00:13:47,954 --> 00:13:49,360
What a mess. What should I do?

172
00:13:49,555 --> 00:13:51,486
The letter... wait, I have a brilliant idea!

173
00:13:51,570 --> 00:13:52,806
Guess there's no choice.

174
00:13:52,947 --> 00:13:55,060
Look, this one tastes much better!

175
00:13:55,900 --> 00:13:57,073
Such a waste.

176
00:13:57,100 --> 00:13:58,840
But it's for work.

177
00:14:00,910 --> 00:14:02,640
Hey, give me more.

178
00:14:02,920 --> 00:14:03,260
Wait!

179
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:03,700
Greedy!

180
00:14:03,725 --> 00:14:04,420
Don't say that!

181
00:14:04,795 --> 00:14:06,939
Fine, I'll eat this letter then.

182
00:14:07,575 --> 00:14:09,019
No, no, stop! Stop!

183
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:11,626
Fine, I'll give it to you! Happy?

184
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:15,000
One more!

185
00:14:15,780 --> 00:14:16,560
What are you talking about?

186
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:18,480
At this rate, no matter how much I have, it won't be enough.

187
00:14:18,999 --> 00:14:20,634
I guess I fail...

188
00:14:20,659 --> 00:14:21,659
as a spy.

189
00:14:26,389 --> 00:14:27,519
There, you're fine now.

190
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:29,540
Time to get dinner ready.

191
00:14:29,845 --> 00:14:30,480
Yay!

192
00:14:30,481 --> 00:14:31,481
Dinner!

193
00:14:31,729 --> 00:14:32,900
Food!

194
00:14:35,862 --> 00:14:37,029
Open up!

195
00:14:37,280 --> 00:14:38,593
Stop trying to eat the little goats!

196
00:14:38,949 --> 00:14:39,846
I'm scared!

197
00:14:40,220 --> 00:14:40,560
Hey!

198
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:41,400
Open up!

199
00:14:41,430 --> 00:14:42,430
You dirty wolf!

200
00:14:42,740 --> 00:14:43,500
Open up!

201
00:14:50,159 --> 00:14:53,560
Even disguised as a goat, I know you're a wolf!

202
00:14:58,834 --> 00:15:00,500
They're coming in!

203
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:07,320
I won't fall for that trick!

204
00:15:21,299 --> 00:15:22,446
Where did they hide?

205
00:15:25,689 --> 00:15:27,440
Don't take our dinner!

206
00:15:52,233 --> 00:15:52,721
How's that!

207
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:53,435
How's that!

208
00:15:53,460 --> 00:15:54,199
Have you had enough?!

209
00:16:14,669 --> 00:16:16,666
Mother!

210
00:16:18,575 --> 00:16:20,980
Don't let the children see me!

211
00:16:25,085 --> 00:16:27,420
You're a wolf, so why are you living with those little ones?

212
00:16:27,835 --> 00:16:31,540
I am the wife of Zubora the lynx, master of Zubora Forest.

213
00:16:32,115 --> 00:16:36,580
My husband Zubora ate their mother a while ago.

214
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:40,840
Then he ordered me to raise those little ones.

215
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,000
Zubora did?

216
00:16:44,425 --> 00:16:47,253
That cruel Zubora told you to raise those little ones?

217
00:16:47,420 --> 00:16:47,946
Yes!

218
00:16:48,160 --> 00:16:50,880
He's fattening them up so he can eat them himself!

219
00:16:51,300 --> 00:16:52,300
That damn Zubora!

220
00:16:53,115 --> 00:16:57,119
I've been raising these kids, pretending to be their mother.

221
00:16:58,189 --> 00:17:03,200
They completely believe I'm their real mother and have grown so attached to me.

222
00:17:04,730 --> 00:17:05,730
You're not lying, are you?

223
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:07,560
Please believe me.

224
00:17:07,979 --> 00:17:10,319
Lately, I’ve truly grown to love those children.

225
00:17:10,344 --> 00:17:14,800
Even if my husband, Zubora, comes for them, I have no intention of giving them up!

226
00:17:15,514 --> 00:17:20,319
A wolf raising goats... Why shouldn't a family like that exist?

227
00:17:23,779 --> 00:17:27,005
My, what a kind-hearted wolf she is, honestly.

228
00:17:29,209 --> 00:17:31,620
Still, sympathy is out of the question. I'm a spy.

229
00:17:31,814 --> 00:17:34,100
Spy News Flash: Operation Grass-Hide! Hah!

230
00:17:37,039 --> 00:17:39,020
My husband has arrived!

231
00:17:39,259 --> 00:17:41,260
The day to eat those kids has finally come!

232
00:17:41,980 --> 00:17:42,980
What should we do?

233
00:17:55,669 --> 00:17:57,360
Is it all right if I defeat Zubora?

234
00:17:58,800 --> 00:17:59,040
Yes

235
00:17:59,169 --> 00:18:00,720
If it will save the children.

236
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:21,740
Have the kids grown big?

237
00:18:23,399 --> 00:18:25,000
Yes, they've grown big.

238
00:18:26,269 --> 00:18:28,060
Are they plump enough to eat?

239
00:18:29,100 --> 00:18:30,227
They're nice and fat.

240
00:18:30,251 --> 00:18:34,500
But before eating that feast, I feel like taking a bite of you!

241
00:18:41,599 --> 00:18:44,140
Ow! My tongue! Now I can't eat my feast!

242
00:18:45,024 --> 00:18:46,904
Damn it!

243
00:20:00,779 --> 00:20:03,080
I wonder if there's any beautiful scenery around.

244
00:20:03,165 --> 00:20:05,940
I'd take some wonderful photos.

245
00:20:11,800 --> 00:20:12,800
It's a monster!

246
00:20:12,954 --> 00:20:15,086
All right, I'll take a picture of it!

247
00:20:19,904 --> 00:20:22,480
S-S-S-Sapphire is in a p-p-pinch!

248
00:20:37,429 --> 00:20:42,126
Lord Sapphire, I'm here to help!

249
00:20:44,339 --> 00:20:45,720
Prepare yourself!

250
00:20:52,639 --> 00:20:53,760
Where are you, monster?

251
00:21:02,569 --> 00:21:04,140
Thank you, Garigori.

252
00:21:08,299 --> 00:21:10,339
I'm so glad you're safe.

253
00:21:11,434 --> 00:21:13,720
Spy News Flash: The return of Uncle Bond!

254
00:21:17,489 --> 00:21:19,700
I finally stole it! Here it is!

255
00:21:19,805 --> 00:21:21,240
Hey, hey, hey!

256
00:21:24,420 --> 00:21:25,420
It's a...

257
00:21:25,605 --> 00:21:26,751
Thief!

258
00:21:27,200 --> 00:21:28,200
Thief!

259
00:21:31,102 --> 00:21:32,429
Thief!

260
00:21:32,475 --> 00:21:34,094
Feast!

261
00:21:34,118 --> 00:21:36,540
Lord Feast!

262
00:21:37,360 --> 00:21:38,360
My children!

263
00:21:39,003 --> 00:21:43,419
It's a feast! We want
to eat! We want to eat!

264
00:21:43,443 --> 00:21:44,631
Wait!

265
00:21:44,655 --> 00:21:45,792
Thief!

266
00:21:45,816 --> 00:21:47,296
Lord Feast!

267
00:21:47,322 --> 00:21:48,948
Feast!

268
00:21:53,214 --> 00:21:55,200
Spy News Flash: Operation Case Closed!

269
00:22:12,284 --> 00:22:13,920
I don't blame you for being scared.

270
00:22:14,095 --> 00:22:15,600
I'm a wolf.

271
00:22:16,159 --> 00:22:18,400
Look, this is our mom.

272
